# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token. Cookie-free, so no consent banner is
# needed. When unset, Base.astro emits no analytics at all rather than a broken
# beacon — local and preview builds stay clean.
#
# Only set this if you are NOT enabling Web Analytics from the Cloudflare Pages
# dashboard. Pages injects the same beacon automatically when that toggle is on,
# and setting a token here as well would load it twice.
PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
